  check: the inverse as printed, evaluated after f: gives back x for every x (65536 inputs)
  characteristic polynomial: x^16 + 1 = (x + 1)^16
  order 4: applying the map 4 times gives the identity (M^4 = I and no M^(4/r) = I, by matrix powers; it divides the order of x mod the characteristic polynomial)
